1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:00,950
Ever wondered why

2
00:00:00,950 --> 00:00:02,683
bus seats look like this?

3
00:00:02,703 --> 00:00:04,793
Like a carpet from 1987

4
00:00:04,793 --> 00:00:06,063
had a bad dream.

5
00:00:06,083 --> 00:00:07,283
It's not bad taste.

6
00:00:07,283 --> 00:00:08,597
It's camouflage.

7
00:00:08,617 --> 00:00:09,737
Thousands of people

8
00:00:09,737 --> 00:00:10,955
sit there every week.

9
00:00:10,975 --> 00:00:11,865
Coffee spills.

10
00:00:11,865 --> 00:00:12,725
Muddy bags.

11
00:00:12,725 --> 00:00:13,976
Mystery stains.

12
00:00:13,996 --> 00:00:15,072
Is that wet?

13
00:00:15,092 --> 00:00:16,102
On a plain seat,

14
00:00:16,102 --> 00:00:17,905
you'd see every single mark.

15
00:00:17,925 --> 00:00:19,055
On a busy pattern,

16
00:00:19,055 --> 00:00:20,609
your brain can't find them.

17
00:00:20,629 --> 00:00:21,949
So the seat looks cleaner

18
00:00:21,949 --> 00:00:22,967
than it really is.

19
00:00:22,987 --> 00:00:24,057
The pattern also hides

20
00:00:24,057 --> 00:00:25,237
wear and tear,

21
00:00:25,237 --> 00:00:26,347
and makes scribbles

22
00:00:26,347 --> 00:00:27,230
harder to spot.

23
00:00:27,250 --> 00:00:28,050
So the seats can stay

24
00:00:28,050 --> 00:00:29,733
in service for longer.

25
00:00:29,753 --> 00:00:30,563
Ugly? Maybe.

26
00:00:30,563 --> 00:00:32,400
Genius? Absolutely.

27
00:00:32,420 --> 00:00:33,780
Next time you sit down,

28
00:00:33,780 --> 00:00:34,830
maybe don't think about it

29
00:00:34,830 --> 00:00:35,742
too hard.

30
00:00:35,762 --> 00:00:36,662
Follow for more

31
00:00:36,662 --> 00:00:37,749
hidden designs.
